    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it just feels so much more dignified than just waiting around to be crushed by it all. like, if i stay, i'm just part of the wreckage. if i go now, i'm leaving with some piece of myself intact. does it even make sense to hold on to something that's already dead?",
